# Visual regression: P1 darkest, P2 second, A-E progressively lighter, F icy white.
# All nodes have deep-blue centers; the smaller original-color satellite sits
# between the lower-left orbit nodes without hiding either slot.
notips
expect bank 3
tap SAVE
expect savemenu 1
wait 50
shot orbit-p1-deep-blue.png
spin K1 1
wait 50
shot orbit-p2-second-blue.png
spin K1 1
wait 50
shot orbit-a-third-blue.png
spin K1 5
wait 50
shot orbit-f-icy-blue.png
tap HOME
expect savemenu 0
